module gunbc.plans.fact_provenance_topology

data fact_provenance_topology_authority_note: String = "AUTH-0 design authority (session cool-ram-632, 2026-08-04). Subject: fact provenance — for a modeled fact, where does it live, and is it in the right kind of position (DESIGN section 3 fact-home), NOT permission-to-act (std.access). Product: a specimen record plus step-2 live censuses naming relation kinds, discharge evidence, and maximum conclusions per census row. Explicitly NOT a hub, construction wall, or no-growth frontier — step 3 is operator-sequenced after censuses adjudicate. Bound doc: docs/plans/fact-provenance-topology-design.md via gunbc.doc_graph_roots HandAuthoredDocBind slug fact-provenance-topology-design. Dissolves when each relation kind has a construction wall or honest ratchet row and candidate censuses are enrolled with RED controls or refuted."
